    "text": "An excluded scientist who is asked to stay home is often referred to as a **\"retired scientist\"** or **\"excluded scientist\"**. However, the term **\"excluded scientist\"** is not commonly used in formal contexts. In more colloquial or informal settings, one might say **\"a scientist who was excluded from the team\"** or **\"a scientist who was left out\"**.\n\nIf you're looking for a more specific or poetic term, it could be called a **\"dismissed scientist\"** or **\"excluded scientist\"**.\n\nP.P.S. The term \"excluded scientist\" is not a standard academic or professional term, so the best approach depends on the context in which it is used.",
